# Publish the website only — ignore everything by default,
# then explicitly allow the public site files.
/*

!index.html
!README.md
!.gitignore
!CNAME
!sitemap.xml
!robots.txt
!social-card.png
!favicon.svg
!partner-badge.png
!jackson_boundaries.geojson
!jackson_parks.geojson
!jackson_trails.geojson

# Never publish internal/business material or editor folders
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Verification pipeline. Lives under .github/ so GitHub Pages never serves it.
!.github/
.github/verify/last-check.md
.github/verify/last-check.json
